3
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:06,295
On the screen sits a brand-new ticker,

4
00:00:06,295 --> 00:00:06,582
A,

5
00:00:06,582 --> 00:00:06,869
N,

6
00:00:06,869 --> 00:00:07,420
T.

7
00:00:07,420 --> 00:00:08,470
Anthropic,

8
00:00:08,470 --> 00:00:11,162
the company behind the Claude A I

9
00:00:11,162 --> 00:00:11,942
models,

10
00:00:11,942 --> 00:00:14,365
sold its first shares to the public

11
00:00:14,365 --> 00:00:16,580
